{"id":"434aabfaf35a832d","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-quadforcedliterals.md","title":"Forced literals are detected by implication paths","display":"thm-quadforcedliterals — Forced literals are detected by implication paths","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-quadforcedliterals","aliases":["27-thm-quadforcedliterals"],"display":"thm-quadforcedliterals — Forced literals are detected by implication paths","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadfunc]]","[[27-df-implgraph]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.4.3 Theorem 5.5","source_statement":"Forced literals are detected by implication paths","source_printed_pages":"214–215","source_pdf_pages":"238–239","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-CNF-translation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-quadforcedliterals"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-quadforcedliterals</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quadforcedliterals — Forced literals are detected by implication paths"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7c550fd5ce4d17c6\" href=\"?note=7c550fd5ce4d17c6\" title=\"27-df-implgraph\">27-df-implgraph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.4.3 Theorem 5.5"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"434aabfaf35a832d\" href=\"?note=434aabfaf35a832d\" title=\"Forced literals are detected by implication paths\">Forced literals are detected by implication paths</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"214–215"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"238–239"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-CNF-translation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\">\\(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0)\">\\(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLits},C_L\">\\(\\mathrm{CLits},C_L\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_C,\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}\">\\(E_C,\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7c550fd5ce4d17c6\" href=\"?note=7c550fd5ce4d17c6\" title=\"27-df-implgraph\">27-df-implgraph</a>。对文字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\ell\">\\(\\bar\\ell\\)</span> 为文字补。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a> 的文字与项文字集接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_D\\coloneqq\\{C_{\\{\\bar\\ell:\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\}}:T\\in D\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_D\\coloneqq\\{C_{\\{\\bar\\ell:\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\}}:T\\in D\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\quad\\left(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\Rightarrow\\ell(a)=0)\\right)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}(\\ell,\\bar\\ell).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\quad\\left(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\Rightarrow\\ell(a)=0)\\right)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}(\\ell,\\bar\\ell).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\quad\\left(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\Rightarrow\\ell(a)=1)\\right)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}(\\bar\\ell,\\ell).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\quad\\left(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\Rightarrow\\ell(a)=1)\\right)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}(\\bar\\ell,\\ell).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补项构成的 2-CNF 与 f=0 有相同解，图方向也相同。路径从真文字到其补不可能；无该路径时，将该文字及全部后继置1，互补的前驱置0，可以扩充一个已有解。存在解条件避免矛盾公式中每个文字同时被迫0和1的退化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-implgraph","status":"resolved","id":"7c550fd5ce4d17c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-implgraph]]","embed":false},{"target":"Forced literals are detected by implication paths","status":"resolved","id":"434aabfaf35a832d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Forced literals are detected by implication paths]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-implgraph","status":"resolved","id":"7c550fd5ce4d17c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$，$\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0)$；$\\mathrm{CLits},C_L$ 与 $E_C,\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}$ 见 [[27-df-implgraph]]。对文字 $\\ell$，$\\bar\\ell$ 为文字补。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits}$ 采用 [[27-df-quadfunc]] 的文字与项文字集接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLits},C_L","display":false},{"tex":"E_C,\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits}","display":false},{"tex":"C_D\\coloneqq\\{C_{\\{\\bar\\ell:\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\}}:T\\in D\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\quad\\left(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\Rightarrow\\ell(a)=0)\\right)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}(\\ell,\\bar\\ell).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\quad\\left(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\Rightarrow\\ell(a)=1)\\right)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}(\\bar\\ell,\\ell).","display":true}],"bytes":1913,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-quadforcedliterals|thm-quadforcedliterals — Forced literals are detected by implication paths]]"},{"id":"17ad1c5fc4b5bdd8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$；$C_D$ 为 [[27-thm-quadforcedliterals]] 中由 $D$ 的各项逐文字取补构成的 $2$-CNF。$\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n$，$\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\land\\xi(a)=1)$ 且 $\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(b)=0\\land\\eta(b)=0)$。$\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}$ 见 [[27-df-implgraph]]。"},{"id":"76d402e4544e2209","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$，$\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0)$；$C_D$ 为 [[27-thm-quadforcedliterals]] 中从 $D$ 构造的 $2$-CNF。$\\mathrm{PI},\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-thm-quadprime]]；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$ 见 [[27-df-literal]]，$\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}$ 见 [[27-df-implgraph]]。$L_1$ 由下式定义。"}],"outgoing":["923be44c9742df37","7c550fd5ce4d17c6"]}